{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07042","headline":"朱放自杭州与故里相使君立碑回因以奉简吏部杨侍郎制文 · 刘长卿","name":"朱放自杭州与故里相使君立碑回因以奉简吏部杨侍郎制文","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"片石羊公後，凄凉江水滨。\n好辞千古事，堕泪万家人。\n鵩集占书久，鸾回刻篆新。\n不堪相顾恨，文字日生尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07042.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07042","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}